The diff changes the comments of the existing `detailTextSendUsageData` and `detailTextStudies` keys from curly quotes (“Firefox Focus”) to escaped straight quotes. These keys are already shipped and localized. Changing the comments alters the `.xliff` `note` that is sent to translators and may re-flag strings for no functional reason. It's also inconsistent with neighbouring entries like `labelTouchIDLoginDescription`, which still use curly quotes.

::diff{file="focus-ios/Blockzilla/UIComponents/UIConstants.swift" lines="202-205"}

Revert the comment edits on existing keys. Keep the new keys consistent with the existing style.
